# the registry and the manifest agree, every file is a row, every global skill is approved
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
registry and manifest aligned (4 skills)
skills/ on disk matches overlay.manifest (4 files)
global skill approvals verified (3 skills: 3 approved, 0 grandfathered)
--- stderr ---

# the paths named
$ skills validate --registry <WORLD>/skills.registry.yaml --manifest <WORLD>/overlay.manifest --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
registry and manifest aligned (4 skills)
skills/ on disk matches overlay.manifest (4 files)
global skill approvals verified (3 skills: 3 approved, 0 grandfathered)
--- stderr ---

# the source root is required
$ skills validate
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: skills validate requires --source-root <skills-dir>

